claim.claim-text:
a chassis including at least one traction drive device;
a boom supported by the chassis;
a cutting device supported by the boom, the cutting device including a cutting disc having a cutting edge, the cutting disc rotatable about a cutting device axis; and
a stabilizer for supporting the chassis relative to a mine surface, the stabilizer including a pad, an actuator, and a support member, the pad configured to engage the mine surface, the actuator including a first end coupled to the chassis and a second end coupled to the pad, the support member including a first end coupled to the chassis and a second end coupled to at least one of the pad and the actuator.
